---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../components/Sidebar.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="IPO Advisory Services | Public Listing Readiness — Aakkam Corporate Solutions"
  description="End-to-end Initial Public Offering (IPO) advisory: public readiness assessment, underwriter selection, DRHP and MD&A drafting, and regulatory SEBI/SEC compliance."
>

  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950 via-slate-900 to-blue-950 text-white py-10 sm:py-14 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <span class="inline-block bg-red-600 text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-3">
        Public Capital Markets
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">
        IPO Advisory Services
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mt-3 text-base sm:text-lg">
        Navigating the journey from private enterprise to public listing with institutional precision.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 sm:py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-start">
      
      <main class="lg:col-span-8 bg-white p-5 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight pb-3 border-b border-slate-100">
          IPO Advisory Services
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          The decision to go public through an Initial Public Offering (IPO) is one of the most critical that a business owner can face. Taking a business public is a complicated and time-consuming process that is fraught with many hurdles and pitfalls. The myriad of issues and problems that must be addressed to achieve a successful offering require the involvement of an experienced advisor. At Aakkam we have the breadth and depth of expertise to guide you through this process. Our services are designed to assist business owners at every step of the process.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Phase 1: Readiness Assessment</h3>
        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          Our team will assist in determining whether an IPO is the right step in the company's development. We assess whether the business is ready to operate as a public company, reviewing whether the system of internal controls is sufficient, whether financial information meets statutory registration requirements, and ensuring appropriate executive compensation arrangements are in place to motivate leadership in a public environment.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          If an IPO isn't the right immediate step, our <strong>Strategy Group</strong> helps identify high-value alternatives, including strategic joint ventures, private equity investment, or merger opportunities.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Phase 2: Underwriter Selection & Registration</h3>
        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          We work with you to select the best underwriter for your offering based upon factors including experience with similar companies, syndication and distribution capabilities, and cost. We guide you throughout the registration process, including drafting the registration statement (DRHP), responding to regulatory comments, and drafting required financial information and MD&A.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Phase 3: Post-Listing Compliance</h3>
        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          Once public, the company will face additional reporting requirements, including periodic financial statement requirements, board committee compliance, and supplemental information reporting for analysts and institutional investors.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-6">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex justify-center items-center px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-white bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 shadow-sm transition-all"
          >
            Schedule IPO Consultation →
          </a>
        </div>
      </main>

      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <Sidebar currentPath="/ipo" />
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
